# Opus Quad fixture: constructed-opus-status-deck1-master
# Constructed from the documented layout, not a capture: no published
# source quotes an Opus Quad status packet.
# Layout: https://djl-analysis.deepsymmetry.org/djl-analysis/vcdj.html#cdj-status-packet
# Opus specifics: name "OPUS-QUAD" and device numbers 9-12 for decks 1-4
#   (https://github.com/kyleawayan/opus-quad-pro-dj-link-analysis/blob/main/README.md#cdj-statuses),
#   P2 = 0xfa while playing
#   (https://github.com/Deep-Symmetry/beat-link/blob/main/src/main/java/org/deepsymmetry/beatlink/CdjStatus.java, `OPUS_MOVING`).
# Documented in: docs/protocols/opus-quad.md#status-packet-fields
# The length 0xd4 is the nexus length; the Opus Quad's real length is not
# published. Deck 1 (device 0x09) playing, tempo master, on air:
# F = 0xec, track 124.00 BPM, Pitch1 0x10147b (+0.5 %), beat 65, bar beat 1,
# Mm = 1, track ID 829.
# Bytes: UDP payload, hex, 16 per line.
